{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一条大号粗体白字，尤其是粉色高亮的“心里又热了起来”和“还能有那样的相处”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去自然亲近的日子，盼望以后还能重新拥有那样的相处；至于他现在最终决定怎么面对过去，不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、怀念、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他重新有了生活的劲头，随后又担心还要等很久才能遇到亲近的人，最后决定无论未来有没有这样的人，都要好好过自己的日子，不再为了留住谁而忍受委屈。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"四块大号粗体文字都很显眼，各自有不同颜色的重点词，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在四块里，要拼接前后的情绪变化才能理解最终处境和决定。\",\n    \"每块主句下方还有一行较小的说明文字，连续堆叠，增加扫视时的信息分流。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "02d12800-f705-4265-8d1b-4a5d0e471627", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014420580709Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:45:01.029271+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d3e84fd59de138aaba0746cd750cbfe466eeabda97224e59fcd75a7e0bbf02bb", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308c